{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39246","headline":"旅中感遇寄呈李秘书昆仲 · 韦庄","name":"旅中感遇寄呈李秘书昆仲","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"南望愁云鏁翠微，谢家楼阁雨霏霏。\n刘桢病後新诗少，阮籍贫来好客稀。\n犹喜故人天外至，许将孤劒日边归。\n怀乡不怕严陵笑，只待秋风别钓矶。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦庄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39246.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39246","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}